Description: generate one harness tree per target instead of only claude-code
Author: Azhou AI Hub
Forwarded: no

The generator hardcoded TREE = "claude-code" and one adapter document, so a
second runtime could not be emitted without forking the script. A target table
now drives the tree name, adapter path and label, and the build reports each
tree it wrote.

Single-target output is unchanged apart from the README sentence that named the
installed tree, which now reads from the table.

